BT /F1 11 Tf 56 770 Td 15 TL (Harbor Point Site: Emergency Response Plan \(page 1 of 2\)) Tj T* () Tj T* (The assembly point is gate 4, next to the canteen.) Tj T* () Tj T* (The fire alarm is a continuous siren. A gas leak alarm is three short sirens, repeated.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Everyone must leave the building by the nearest exit and go to the assembly point.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Nobody may re-enter until the site controller gives the all-clear. The site controller) Tj T* (is the duty manager on shift.) Tj T* () Tj ET
