BT /F1 11 Tf 56 770 Td 15 TL (Drills and contacts \(page 2 of 2\)) Tj T* () Tj T* (Fire drills are held every quarter. Gas leak drills are held every 6 months.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Visitors must be signed in so they can be counted at the assembly point.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Fire marshals wear yellow vests and should check every room before leaving.) Tj T* () Tj T* (The emergency number is 4400. First aid kits are in the control room and at gate 4.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Operators must report every near miss within 24 hours.) Tj T* () Tj ET
